WEBVTT

00:00:05.847 --> 00:00:11.847
Choose Upload in the side menu.

00:00:17.537 --> 00:00:23.537
Check the Files at once line.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:34.960
Click Choose videos and pick a file.

00:00:41.324 --> 00:00:47.324
Check the Upload queue for the
message under the file name.

00:00:56.774 --> 00:01:02.774
Select a file that was not
added and click Remove.
